agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:57:        "TopicObservationTests.test_restricted_observation_remains_pending_and_replays",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:58:        "TopicObservationTests.test_cross_batch_duplicate_source_is_not_reimported",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:60:        "DogfoodArchiveTests.test_three_real_archives_persist_replay_budget_and_nonpromotion_boundaries"
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:63:      "details": "Normal import, idempotent replay, pending replay, duplicate and cursor behavior, manual review, archive replay, budget checks, and no-claim/no-trace boundaries remain passing."
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:73:    "legacy_versions": [
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:78:    "behavior": "The input-projection fields are required for state schema 1.3. Legacy 1.0, 1.1, and 1.2 state is preserved byte-for-byte and fails closed with an explicit recovery-contract error; the loader never silently upgrades, rewrites, or discards it. An operator must preserve the legacy state and replay authoritative source batches into a new state root under the 1.3 recovery contract. No claim, trace, or promotion recovery is implied.",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:113:  "residual_local_digest_trust_boundary": "The local result, batch, projection, and archive-related digests plus persisted-source readback detect the requested coordinated replay mutations, but a fully compromised host can rewrite every local state input and recompute every local digest. This bounded repair has no external trust anchor and establishes no production/device or remote readback evidence.",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-review-lanes/final/returns/A4-manual-linkage-final-review.md:7:  finding: No fail-open `continue`, weak queue-only shortcut, or state-ordering bypass was found. `manual_queue` and `next_cursor` both call `_load_state`; `run()` calls `_load_state` before checking the replayed batch digest. `_load_state` validates the complete manual queue before batches, validates every stored result before adding it to `validated_batches`, and validates the complete cursor chain before returning state.
